; MARA pad check: camera and platform from TEST mode, ending back in IDLE.
; Times are relative to the previous command. The platform target (500 counts) must be a
; small, safe move inside MIN/MAX_POSITION; adjust it after commissioning.
R00:00:00 Mara.orchestrator.enterTestMode
R00:00:01 Mara.orchestrator.testOpticalCameraON
R00:00:02 Mara.orchestrator.testPlatformMoveTo 500
R00:00:05 Mara.orchestrator.testPlatformMoveTo 0
R00:00:05 Mara.orchestrator.testOpticalCameraOFF
R00:00:01 Mara.orchestrator.exitTestMode
